  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating App Design**\n\nI\'m starting the design for \"\350\207\252\345\276\213\345\212\251\346\211\213\" (Self-Discipline Coach). First, I am considering the essential feature: sleep and wake records with analytics. A form will log the sleep and wake times for tracking.\n\n\n**Visualizing Sleep Patterns**\n\nI\'m now focused on visualizing sleep patterns. I am leaning toward custom CSS and SVG charts. Handcrafted charts look more unique. Automatic bedtime routine suggestions are also in consideration. I will integrate nutrition tracking next, as a logical extension of health data logging.\n\n\n**Expanding App Feature Scope**\n\nI\'m now integrating nutrition tracking. I\'ll allow users to log meals, with an automated health score (based on calories and macros like protein, fats, and carbs). A \"\350\220\245\345\205\273\345\270\210\350\247\243\347\255\224\" (Nutritionist Answers) section will provide instant analysis based on those logged meals. I also plan to store meal histories locally, either via `localStorage` or server syncing. After that, I will move on to the fitness tracker feature.\n\n\n**Expanding App Horizons**\n\nI\'m now integrating ambitious lifelong learning features! I\'m planning a \"\346\214\221\346\210\230\346\250\241\345\274\217\" (Challenge Mode) with trackable achievements. Users can check off challenges and save them. A \"\344\271\246\351\246\231\345\215\260\350\256\260\" (Reading Notes) will let users record book details and summaries. I\'m also planning a \"\345\255\246\344\271\240\350\267\257\347\272\277\345\233\276\350\247\204\345\210\222\" (Learning Path Builder) powered by Gemini, which creates structured milestone paths for users to master any cognitive subject. Finally, I\'m thinking of building a professional and beautiful UI that is both mobile-first and desktop-friendly.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now update `/metadata.json` with a descriptive, literal name (\"\350\207\252\345\276\213\345\212\251\346\211\213\") and an accurate description reflecting the features requested by the user."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 863034865
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
