  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Component Features**\n\nI\'ve completed the preliminary feature breakdown, and I\'m feeling good. I\'ve got the foundational components outlined for the Routine/Sleep and Diet sections now; `SleepSection.tsx` handles sleep tracking, visualizations, and action plans, while `DietSection.tsx` focuses on diet logging and AI advice. I\'m moving toward integrating these into the application.\n\n\n**Integrating New Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating the additional components. I\'m adding `WorkoutSection.tsx`, `ChallengeSection.tsx`, and `LearningSection.tsx`. These components, coupled with calorie and macro breakdowns, and a score, will integrate into a unified mobile-friendly app. My current focus is to develop `App.tsx` with Chinese support, `localStorage` persistence and the correct fonts. I\'ve verified the font imports in `index.html` and `src/index.css`.\n\n\n**Refining UI Design**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in UI refinement for `/src/App.tsx`. I\'m starting by establishing a mobile-first responsive design with a top-tab navigation, ensuring a clean and intuitive user experience. Local storage integration is also a key priority. I\'m focusing on crafting a responsive layout, handling narrow dimensions gracefully with large touch targets, while ensuring the UI never breaks.\n\n\n**Designing Dashboard Summary**\n\nI\'m now devising the dashboard summary, intending it as a daily motivation. I\'m focused on a \"Self-Discipline Score\" widget at the top, incorporating sleep, diet, workouts, challenges, and learning milestones to provide a visual recap. I\'ll need to source daily quotes and ensure high-contrast visuals, where sector colors are now assigned. I\'m focusing on ensuring these dashboard features are accessible and functional in Chinese. I\'m also ensuring that `App.tsx` handles all top-level states.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now implement the parent container `/src/App.tsx`. This acts as the central dashboard hub for our Self-Discipline App (\"\350\207\252\345\276\213\345\212\251\346\211\213\"). It manages client-side persistence (using `localStorage` so that data is saved and loads automatically on subsequent visits), manages state transition for all 5 sectors (Sleep, Diet, Workout, Skill challenges, and Lifelong learning), calculates a dynamic \"\350\207\252\345\276\213\350\207\252\347\234\201\346\227\245\345\216\206\344\270\216\346\214\207\346\225\260\" (Self-Discipline Score) indicating daily accomplishment, and provides a fully responsive layout tailored for both mobile tapping and desktop screens. Let\'s write the code."
