  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Daily Diet**\n\nI\'m currently focused on developing a system for one-stop dietary analysis. My primary goal is to allow users to upload photos of their meals, with an AI system intelligently populating the relevant food entries. I aim for three automatic updates per day; additional meals would require manual input from the user.\n\n\n**Refining Image Analysis**\n\nI\'ve made progress on the image analysis component. The plan is to use `@google/genai` to parse uploaded image data. I\'m building a server endpoint, `/api/analyze-diet-image`, to handle base64 image data and extract food details. I\'m focused on the constraints: limiting AI analysis to three photos per day and requiring manual input for others.\n\n**Simplifying Data Entry**\n\nI\'m working on streamlining data entry for sleep and exercise. For sleep, I\'ll offer \"quick check-in\" options, like one-click inputs for common schedules or modifications of those templates. For exercise, I\'ll provide pre-set options for common activities to ease input. My focus is reducing the complexity of recording data.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 502303359
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
